            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If there is no more than 1 friendly **Feculent Gnarlmaw** on the battlefield, you can set up a **Feculent Gnarlmaw** wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and more than 3&quot; from all enemy units, objectives and other terrain features.</characteristic>
