            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 2+, pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn:
***Tally of Blows:*** Add 1 to wound rolls for the target&apos;s combat attacks.
