            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit&apos;s **Mire Kelpies** are tokens. There are 6 **Mire Kelpies** for every 14 models in this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Contagious Catarrh" id="4249-80b3-770b-17f7" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit has any **Mire Kelpies**, pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target. You cannot pick a **^^Manifestation^^** or terrain feature.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick any number of this unit&apos;s **Mire Kelpies** and remove them from the battlefield. Then, roll a dice, adding 1 to the roll for each **Mire Kelpie** you removed this phase. On an unmodified roll of 1, this ability has no effect. On a 6+, the target has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
